{"articleNo":"2580","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2580&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"강의평가 결과 공개 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.28","hit":"14721","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 37.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◆ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">강의평가 결과를 다음과 같이 공개할 예정이오니, 학생 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">수강신청</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 등에 활용 하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 64.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -64.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;가. 2010-1학기 강의평가결과 학부별 전임교원 상위 20%의 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">명단 및 과목별 평가점수 공개</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 공개기간 : 2010. 7. 28(수) 10:00 ～ 8. 15(일)까</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt\">2) 조회방법 : 원스톱서비스→수업 메뉴에『강의평가 결과조회』</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;※ 조회가능자 : 원스톱서비스를 이용하는 교직원 및 학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 과목별 강의평가 점수 공개(2학기 개설강좌 선택시 참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 146pt; TEXT-INDENT: -146pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 공개범위 : 학생이 학기별 수강신청시 개설교과목의 직전 2개년도 중 2회의&nbsp;평가점수를 공개(2008-2, 2009-2학기)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 180.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -180.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 공개대상 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\"> 과목별로 교수 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\">본인이 공개를 원하는 교과목</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 180.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -180.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 공개기간 : 2010. 8. 2(월) 10:00 ～ 8. 20(금)까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 180.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -180.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 조회방법 : 원스톱서비스→수업→개설강좌관련조회</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 180.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -180.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 메뉴에서 교과목별로 평가점수 공개</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
